<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Personal Website</title>
    <style>
        /* Modern Dark Theme Setup */
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #121212;
            color: #e0e0e0;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        /* Navigation Bar */
        nav {
            background-color: #1f1f1f;
            padding: 15px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #333;
        }
        nav a {
            color: #00ffcc;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        nav a:hover {
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        /* Hero Welcome Section */
        .hero {
            padding: 80px 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1f1f1f, #121212);
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: #00ffcc;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #aaaaaa;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto 30px auto;
        }

        /* Call to Action Button */
        .btn {
            background-color: #00ffcc;
            color: #121212;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #00cca3;
        }

        /* Main Content Section */
        .content {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        
        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background-color: #1f1f1f;
            padding: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 60px;
            border-top: 1px solid #333;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Navigation Menu -->
    <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero Introduction -->
    <div class="hero">
        <h1>Welcome to My Website</h1>
        <p>Hi, I'm glad you're here. This is my brand new website hosted entirely for free on GitHub Pages. Explore around to learn more about me!</p>
        <a href="about.html" class="btn">Learn More About Me</a>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content Area -->
    <div class="content">
        <h2>About This Project</h2>
        <p>I built this homepage using HTML and CSS to create a clean, responsive web experience. It adjusts smoothly whether you view it on a computer or a smartphone.</p>
        
        <h2>My Skills & Interests</h2>
        <p>You can use this area to talk about your hobbies, your business, your portfolio, or things you love to do. Change the text to make it entirely yours!</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer Area -->
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 My GitHub Site. Created with HTML & CSS.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
